# Type 1 setup/remove of nginx-adm and the request/approve/reject/publish
# cycle (public /var/nginx-cli queues + home map). Prefix ngx_ is the path-safe domain prefix.
#
# ALIGNMENT:
# - requirement-domain-nginx-cli.md
# - requirement-shell-interactive-vs-noninteractive.md
# - requirement-shell-output-requirements.md
#
